UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'Something plagues this tower. I''ve fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick. Just last week, two of our patrollers died, only to come back to life immediately as mindless drones! The lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information. 
