Tell Kah Mistrunner that I sent ya!', `FemaleText` = 'Don''t blame you for taking up fishing.  Mulgore has some the best fishing spots in Southern Kalimdor and Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise has all of the gear you''ll need to take advantage of it.

