UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'The book tells of dragons uniting against another, more powerful dragon, named Deathwing. From what you can make out, the chromatic dragonflight had almost been unleashed upon the world. The Aspects were prepared.
', `VerifiedBuild` = 22522 WHERE `ID` = 6345;
UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `VerifiedBuild` = 22522 WHERE `ID` = 6346;
UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'Ye might not know it, but in addition to being a skilled tailor, Jormund is also a slayer of giants!  Why he must have overheard a few of us sharing stories when he shouted that he''d killed seven with one blow!  

Ye should pay him a visit at his store on the north side of The Great Forge an'' see if he''ll tell ye the tale!', `FemaleText` = 'Ye might not know it, but in addition to being a skilled tailor, Jormund is also a slayer of giants!  Why he must have overheard a few of us sharing stories when he shouted that he''d killed seven with one blow!  

