UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'An excellent question! We have many things for sale here at the faire. If you are interested in food or drink, then visit Stamp or Sylannia''s booths.

If you''d rather purchase something more exotic, then Lhara may have just the thing for you. She specializes in rarities from all over the world.

And then there is Flik running around here somewhere. If you can grab him he sells balls for throwing and frogs to keep as pets.', `FemaleText` = 'An excellent question! We have many things for sale here at the faire. If you are interested in food or drink, then visit Stamp or Sylannia''s booths.

