UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'We, the Sons of Lothar, have remained here ever since - fighting... dying... praying that a day like today would come - a day when the Portal would open and our brothers would come to deliver us home.$B$BOverjoyed as we are, duty still calls. There is much to be done before we can depart this world and take our rest.
