UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'To prove yourself worthy of the wolf, you must first test your strength and tenacity. 

To do this, you must gather a heavy stone from the quarry and bear it on your back into the lands of your enemy. Once you have cut your way through their ranks, place the stone in a place of prominence, and set upon it a trophy of your foe.

Only then, when your strength is displayed for all to see, can you hope to claim the wolf as your subject.', `VerifiedBuild` = 22522 WHERE `ID` = 85330;
UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'Once your display of strength is set for all to see, you must claim your wolf.

Go to their hunting grounds. There you must find the largest wolf in the pack, and subdue it in the presence of its kin. You will likely be eaten alive, but if you survive the ordeal, the wolf will answer to you as its master.', `VerifiedBuild` = 22522 WHERE `ID` = 85331;
UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'It is not enough that the wolf regard you as its master. To ready your wolf for riding, you must break its will completely.

Once you have subdued your wolf, you will mount it and ride it to the top of the tallest peak in Nagrand. If your wolf is willful, it will throw you to your death on the mountain slopes. 

If you survive to the peak, the will of your wolf will be broken. 

Then, you can call yourself "Wolfrider".', `VerifiedBuild` = 22522 WHERE `ID` = 85332;
