UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'You seem surprised to see us here, $C. It is understandable. I am all too familiar with how the arakkoa have treated your people.

The Adherents of Rukhmar are savage creatures, and their lust for power can only lead to their downfall. We seek a different path.

We search for artifacts of the Apexis so that we may use them to initiate a peaceful new beginning for the arakkoa. In exchange for these relics, we offer finely crafted goods, which we hope you will find equal in value.

Would you see it fit to aid us, $C?', `VerifiedBuild` = 22522 WHERE `ID` = 88041;
