UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'It is good that you have come to Ashran, $C. You will likely be needed in the days to come.

The artifacts found on this island from the ancient ogre kingdom may be the determining factor in our battle against the Iron Horde. Unfortunately, the Horde has decided that they wish to take this knowledge for their own, in spite of our truce.

We must not let the Horde impede our efforts against our foe here on Draenor. Take the battle to them and pry the artifacts from their dead hands if you must!

For the Alliance!', `VerifiedBuild` = 22522 WHERE `ID` = 89245;
UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'Our people appreciate the aid you have lent us against the Adherents of Rukhmar. 

We will not forget your generosity.', `VerifiedBuild` = 22522 WHERE `ID` = 89246;
UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'The appearance of the Order of the Awakened vexes many of the Outcasts. Though they claim their intentions are pure, their kind has wronged us so many times before.

We hope they are true to their words, but for now we will wait and see.', `VerifiedBuild` = 22522 WHERE `ID` = 89247;
UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `MaleText` = 'I am not a fighter myself, but I feel like even the most battle-minded of us should step away from time to time to enjoy some peace and quiet.

For me, there''s no better way to do so then with a fishing rod in your hand and the gentle sounds of the ocean. 

What do you think, $C?', `VerifiedBuild` = 22522 WHERE `ID` = 89248;
