VALUES (106876, 'Another one of Lespin''s thugs? I have had it with him. My pet will teach you a lesson!', 'Another one of Lespin''s thugs? I have had it with him. My pet will teach you a lesson!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 65816, 0, 0, 22522);
