VALUES (109043, 'I''m sure you''re ready to join in on the action. Cobra Shot is your primary ranged attack, pummeling your enemy while your pet keeps their attention.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 59959, 0, 0, 22522);
