VALUES (111888, 'That battle was one part skill, one part strategy, and ten parts adorable! Keep this up kid, you''re going places... and making me a pile of gold in the process!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 22522);
