VALUES (111910, '', '$n! Is it true you wield the Kingslayers? When I was just a girl, my gran told me the stories. The King of Stormwind grasping at his throat, red blood spattered on the white stones of the keep... I would hide under my covers at night, thinking assassins were everywhere.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 22522);
