VALUES (120017, 'On the peaks of Shield''s Rest you will find the Skysunders. These drakes are powerful, ancient, and mad. Gather your allies, hero, and put one of these beasts down for its own sake.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 69766, 0, 0, 22522);
