VALUES (120018, 'The Skysunders were once storm drakes of great honor, charged with the protection of Shield''s Rest. Now they have fallen into the madness of Helya''s dark magics.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 69758, 0, 0, 22522);
