VALUES (120169, 'Haustvald is a sacred place that is currently being defiled by pesky ravens. Filthy creatures and so foul mouthed. Would you make use of that body of yours and a grappling hook and remove some of those nests?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 69768, 0, 0, 22522);
