VALUES (120170, 'Ravens can be so rude sometimes. I am sure you heard all of the uncouth things they were saying about you and your lineage. Thank you for removing their nests.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 69767, 0, 0, 22522);
