VALUES (120830, 'I may only be a journeyman, but I know a trick or two to get the most out of your crew. I''ll make your fire sizzle, your water drizzle, your earths quake and your winds break!', '', 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 22522);
