VALUES (123332, 'Do you see, Farah? $n is here. So long as the spirit of Ursoc walks among us, we have nothing to fear from the harpies.', 'The others have not misled me - the spirit of Ursoc has come to Thunder Totem!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 22522);
