VALUES (123333, '', 'Wait a moment, $n. Is that the ancient bow of the Windrunners? My father fought alongside Alleria in the second war. I never thought we''d see that weapon again...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 22522);
